    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d486">

                <pb facs="0501" n="1235" xml:id="pg1235"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-07-10"><hi rendition="#italic">July 10, 1895</hi></date>.
                        (Received July 26.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 568.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform you that the
                    report of the Turkish minister near you contained in your 503 of the 19th
                    ultimo, is correct. The entire exemption of the college at Scutari, under irade
                    and firman, from taxation is secured, and is a favor without precedent in
                    Turkey</p>
                <p>Your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. W. Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
